<title>USA: U.S. bulk millfeeds - Prices steady to firmer.</title>
<headline>U.S. bulk millfeeds - Prices steady to firmer.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millfeed prices were mostly steady to firmer on Friday as dealers digested the U.S. Department of Agriculture reports on corn and soybean production as well as supply and demand.</p>
<p>&quot;People are stepping aside for today,&quot; one dealer said. Another dealer noted that the CBOT corn rally was strong and many in the millfeeds market would be waiting to see how prices play out for next week.</p>
</text>
